[{"id":3359837764,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7IQw5E","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I think we can safely go ahead with this, but I think it's only a band-aid for a more serious problem of the editor not helping users to follow proper best practices, I'd say a more proper solution to prevent these issues would involve:\r\n* ~Warning, or even throwing an error, when renaming a file just changing the casing on a case-insensitive OS, something like \"cannot rename file on a case-insensitive system, file will not be moved\", alternatively adding some system on these OSes to move a file properly by moving to a temporary and then moving back~ Realized this has actually been fixed already\r\n* Warning on case-sensitive systems when renaming in the same way, saying that \"these changes will have no effect when running on a case-insensitive operating system\" or similar to warn that renaming them and updating VCS won't work on those OSes and will be confusing\r\n* More proactive detection in the editor for case errors, like in `load(\"res://foo/bar.gd)` if there is a file `res://Foo/bar.gd`, not just when running but as a warning in the editor\r\n\r\nEdit: Opened a proposal for usability improvements with respect to casing\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13436","state":"DISMISSED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111858#pullrequestreview-3359837764","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111858","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111858#pullrequestreview-3359837764"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111858"}},"submitted_at":"2025-10-21T10:12:13Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3386126246,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7J1C-m","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111858#pullrequestreview-3386126246","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/